'sail' by raising their flukes and catching the wind.","change":{"kind":"where","old":"off the coast of Argentina","new":"off the coast of Norway","start":26,"end":52},"difficulty":0.6666666666666666,"nli":0.9967,"fact_ids":["562b6a83c636","b87209d5ee78","9b81623e8e69","0cb5f3104cfa","75112879b2b1"]},{"facts":[{"text":"The John Harvard statue at Harvard University is not of John Harvard.","sources":[{"title":"Statue of John Harvard","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Statue_of_John_Harvard"},{"title":"Harvard University","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Harvard_University"},{"title":"John Harvard","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Harvard"}]},{"text":"Because of its system of ravines, Toronto has been described as \"Venice turned upside down\".","sources":[{"title":"Toronto ravine system","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toronto_ravine_system"},{"title":"Toronto","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toronto"},{"title":"San Francisco","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/San_Francisco"}]},{"text":"The 1774 Schiehallion experiment to calculate the density of the Earth also made the first use of contour lines to represent height.","sources":[{"title":"Schiehallion experiment","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Schiehallion_experiment"},{"title":"Density","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Density"},{"title":"Earth","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earth"},{"title":"Contour line","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Contour_line"}]},{"text":"The Erdene Zuu monastery, one of the oldest monasteries in Mongolia, was built in 1585 using stones from the ruins of Genghis Khan's capital, Karakorum.","sources":[{"title":"Erdene Zuu Monastery","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erdene_Zuu_Monastery"},{"title":"Monastery","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monastery"},{"title":"Mongolia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mongolia"},{"title":"Genghis Khan","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Genghis_Khan"},{"title":"Karakorum","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Karakorum"}]},{"text":"The Sparkles emoji (✨) is used by large software companies to represent artificial intelligence.","sources":[{"title":"Sparkles emoji","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sparkles_emoji"},{"title":"Artificial intelligence","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Artificial_intelligence"}]}],"fake":1,"original":"Because of its system of ravines, Toronto has been described as \"San Francisco turned upside down\".","change":{"kind":"where","old":"San Francisco turned upside down","new":"Venice turned upside down","start":65,"end":97},"difficulty":0.6666666666666666,"nli":0.9948,"fact_ids":["2a918ed66955","b493513c9e56","84d7740e9b93","2f2214198dbf","ef34b9615bc6"]},{"facts":[{"text":"Mark Twain and General Custer visited P. T. Barnum in Iranistan.","sources":[{"title":"Mark Twain","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mark_Twain"},{"title":"George Armstrong Custer","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/George_Armstrong_Custer"},{"title":"P. T. Barnum","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/P._T._Barnum"},{"title":"Iranistan","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iranistan"}]},{"text":"Othniel Charles Marsh named two species of the dinosaur Coelurus from the same quarry, not knowing that the bones belonged to the same skeleton.","sources":[{"title":"Othniel Charles Marsh","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Othniel_Charles_Marsh"},{"title":"Dinosaur","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dinosaur"},{"title":"Coelurus","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coelurus"},{"title":"Quarry","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quarry"}]},{"text":"Locusts are the swarming phase of certain species of short-horned grasshoppers.","sources":[{"title":"Locust","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Locust"},{"title":"Swarm behaviour","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Swarm_behaviour"},{"title":"Grasshopper","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grasshopper"}]},{"text":"Japanese game developer Square was told to \"never come back\" by Nintendo after shifting production to the PlayStation.","sources":[{"title":"Square (video game company)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Square_(video_game_company)"},{"title":"Nintendo","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nintendo"},{"title":"PlayStation (console)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PlayStation_(console)"}]},{"text":"Before cola became widespread, the hamburger was typically served with beer.","sources":[{"title":"Cola","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cola"},{"title":"History of the hamburger","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/History_of_the_hamburger"},{"title":"Coffee","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coffee"}]}],"fake":4,"original":"Before cola became widespread, the hamburger was typically served with coffee.","change":{"kind":"what","old":"with coffee","new":"with beer","start":66,"end":77},"difficulty":0.6666666666666666,"nli":0.9811,"fact_ids":["b2d3c462f5d3","a811deff0073","1c6929369052","de13f0d9ee94","ed9c0175a642"]},{"facts":[{"text":"California Creek and Dakota Creek are in Washington.","sources":[{"title":"California Creek (Washington)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/California_Creek_(Washington)"},{"title":"Dakota Creek","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dakota_Creek"},{"title":"Washington (state)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Washington_(state)"}]},{"text":"Terraria was released earlier than planned because a beta version of the game was leaked to the public.","sources":[{"title":"Terraria","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terraria"}]},{"text":"The Christmas tree at Trafalgar Square is transported annually from Stockholm to London and can be up to 75 feet tall.","sources":[{"title":"Trafalgar Square Christmas tree","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trafalgar_Square_Christmas_tree"},{"title":"Trafalgar Square","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trafalgar_Square"},{"title":"Oslo","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oslo"}]},{"text":"A rights dispute meant that two different actors played Quicksilver in two competing film franchises at the same time.","sources":[{"title":"Quicksilver (Marvel Comics)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Quicksilver_(Marvel_Comics)"}]},{"text":"Louis Mountbatten invented Mountbatten pink, a camouflage paint used during World War II.","sources":[{"title":"Lord Mountbatten","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lord_Mountbatten"},{"title":"Mountbatten pink","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mountbatten_pink"},{"title":"Camouflage","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Camouflage"},{"title":"World War II","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/World_War_II"}]}],"fake":2,"original":"The Christmas tree at Trafalgar Square is transported annually from Oslo to London and can be up to 75 feet tall.","change":{"kind":"where","old":"from Oslo to London","new":"from Stockholm to London","start":63,"end":82},"difficulty":0.6666666666666666,"nli":0.9771,"fact_ids":["3f0f242aa9a8","e7a18bfedd79","4a27f145503c","f3c34e947bc2","b797157bf013"]},{"facts":[{"text":"Leonard Nimoy's 1975 autobiography was entitled Live Long and Prosper.","sources":[{"title":"Leonard Nimoy","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leonard_Nimoy"},{"title":"I Am Not Spock","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I_Am_Not_Spock"}]},{"text":"Several freight cars of the Disneyland Railroad originally had no seats because Walt Disney wanted passengers to feel like cattle riding in a real cattle train.","sources":[{"title":"Disneyland Railroad","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disneyland_Railroad"},{"title":"Walt Disney","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Walt_Disney"},{"title":"Stock car (rail)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stock_car_(rail)"}]},{"text":"A nihilist school of metaphysics contends that tables and chairs do not exist.","sources":[{"title":"Mereological nihilism","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mereological_nihilism"},{"title":"Metaphysics","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Metaphysics"}]},{"text":"The historic Slipper Chapel in Norfolk, England was used as a cow-shed and barn for almost 400 years before being rededicated as a chapel in 1934.","sources":[{"title":"Basilica of Our Lady of Walsingham","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Basilica_of_Our_Lady_of_Walsingham"},{"title":"Norfolk","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norfolk"},{"title":"England","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/England"}]},{"text":"Hagia Sophia in Turkey has runic inscriptions left by Vikings.","sources":[{"title":"Hagia Sophia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hagia_Sophia"},{"title":"Turkey","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Turkey"},{"title":"Runic inscriptions in Hagia Sophia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Runic_inscriptions_in_Hagia_Sophia"},{"title":"Vikings","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vikings"}]}],"fake":0,"original":"Leonard Nimoy's 1975 autobiography was entitled I Am Not Spock.","change":{"kind":"what","old":"I Am Not Spock","new":"Live Long and Prosper","start":48,"end":62},"difficulty":0.6666666666666666,"nli":0.9915,"fact_ids":["036323c447fb","a36adba00208","1801889d2551","2a314262a78b","c7fefc1327c0"]}]}